Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs from the Wano 62 Extended Cut release; OP lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:03.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Pay-Pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poo. P-P-Poo. Page One!\NPoo. P-P-P.... Page One!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You burned down Okobore Town?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will suffer my retribution, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt Pay-Pay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- She's coming!\N- She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice! Let's have Big Mom\Ntake her down, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's starting...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:36.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to look like our guardian angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That lady's one of the bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She did the thing that upset you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that tramp, you're up next!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti! Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's take down Big Mom together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After I trounce that old crone,\Nyour end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run for it, Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put some distance between us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:19.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said "Stay right there"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti-Mortar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.89,0:01:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've grown quite weary of this pursuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lion-dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.57,0:01:58.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your swift gait has been a thorn in my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any broken bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Komachiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in quite rough shape, you poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta reap what you sow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now stay down and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.65,0:02:31.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo is my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.11,0:02:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:43.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take her and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:52.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just hurt my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well you just hurt my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You piece of shit lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you harm Otama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hitting a child...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:24.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is where I draw the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick her ass!
