Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:11.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid Swordsmoron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:14.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1620,600)}Second Floor\NInside the Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think now is a good time for a nap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn! Not only are you heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're also unwieldy as hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:22.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrying you is just a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:27.16,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Anarchy In The BM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Black Leg Sanji\Nwith a 330-million-berry bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:37.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check out who he's carrying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that Pirate Hunter Zoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's one big payday stacked on another!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch what you call me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The 330-million is carrying the 320-million!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That isn't any better!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're cramping my style, Moss Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:06:01.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,215)}A short while ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Momo! Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:06.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:09.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:11.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You aren't getting through us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I needed some more scrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, I don't need you chumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,T-Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:46.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you, Big Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I switched us with some airborne debris!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Leg?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:02.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Traffy? Moss Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:10.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.84,0:07:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where am I?! Where's Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:18.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:19.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:24.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you her servant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:27.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never mind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:31.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you lounging on my shoulder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:33.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That spot is reserved for ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.49,0:07:35.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like I chose the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, you didn't! Where did\Nyou guys come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look after him, Black Leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:52.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up! At least explain the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro probably has twenty\Nto thirty broken bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:08:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Splint him up, put him on his back,\Nand make sure he's conscious and breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not his situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you look after him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:10.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to stop Big Mom!\NSurely you can tend to some wounds?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.03,0:08:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:13.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:14.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I don't have time to tend to his wounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:29.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you even know how to apply a bandage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the same as trussing a ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm a ham to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wish you were that appetizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:53.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who managed to rough you up this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:08:59.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No wonder. I can't believe\Nyou made it to the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.45,0:09:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I take it Luffy's holding up okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think he figured something out...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.17,0:09:10.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That goes without saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I oughta just dump you somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are all right! What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:34.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! We've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's gonna get up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know how tough those dinosaurs are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Big Mom is right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:50.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we run away,\Nshe'll never stop chasing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:54.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, she hurt Otama,\Nand that's absolutely unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:57.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama, are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't play dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't play dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you capitulated to\Nyour demise at my hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:24.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no, she's twirling around a baton!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A loser like you is no match\Nagainst Lady Ulti, cheerleader!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tornado...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice surprise attack, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest assured...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:11:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll have your turn\Nonce I'm through with this harlot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:11.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You rankled my senses\Nfrom the moment I saw you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After you scurried away like a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you made that inane joke about\Nyour captain becoming King of the Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:27.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I finally get to smash your head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,NO...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onami...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:42.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:46.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- Combine!\N- Combine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:11.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:47.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, it was Page One...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a-and now, Big Mom took out Ulti, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't she our ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you stand, Nami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:13:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was crazy, but you saved us! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Tama! We can't save him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll come back for him later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who is that thundercloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.59,0:13:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We make one heck of a team, Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:28.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could never pull off that attack\Nwith that airhead Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way, it's because you were\Nso in sync with me, right, Hera?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:35.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea, you silly boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:37.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was just following Mama's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:39.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I asked Mama for a girlfriend\Nand she created you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your girlfriend? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, I like your feisty attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:56.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so refreshing to have a girl with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prometheus...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm sure the three of us\Nwill get along just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Napoleon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:12.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like the team\Nwill be even stronger without Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:15.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mama... Who is that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a great example of what not to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's supposed to be my place... Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I gonna be all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:34.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mama! Sorry I'm late...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do we have a new member?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A team of four sounds perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Four? No, Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:03.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're no longer needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:10.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Sangoro, where are you heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We shall lend whatever meager aid we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was trying to get to Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not headed there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon is heading for him,\Nso all will be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:30.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna help,\Ngo to the Performance Floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just make a request\Nand fall back asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onward! To the Performance Floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Considering their forces, the longer\Nwe take, the more casualties we face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:58.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bagua!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:37.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know exactly how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.91,0:16:44.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a thrill to land a hit on\Nsomeone stronger than you, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:17:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Red Roc!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:22.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beat down guys who were supposed\Nto be stronger than me, one after another,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:26.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, I was\Nthe one being called the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what do I see from the peak?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing but a dull rock, and everyone\Non it can only punch up at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're better off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because you'll never have to feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:18:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan will be destroyed,\Nand Wano will become New Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'll remain in eternal\Nboredom as the strongest...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:26.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan won't be destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.15,0:18:34.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And one more thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I'm gonna become...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were gonna let Mama die earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:01.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you've always been a worthless screw-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all better off without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.89,0:19:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:17.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:18.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By consuming his soul,\Nyou'll become even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you say that, Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to eat him, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus! Thanks for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:43.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make her stop! Please, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for always messing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't want me anymore, I'll leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Quit squirming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll never show my face again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.11,0:20:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:11.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you're nothing but a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're stealing a piece of my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:27.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're truly sorry, then let her\Neat you and take your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please spare me, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Otama?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.53,0:20:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is going to be dangerous, so let's\Nget you somewhere safe, Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:02.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama! You're awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:07.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onami! Usohachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're bad pirates called the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:21.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.69,0:21:25.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.28,0:21:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Olin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:43.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- We're doomed!\N- We're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:45.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for trying to kill you earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:57.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:21:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are so through!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a coward...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I couldn't defy Mama's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.03,0:22:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.16,0:22:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I betrayed your kindness\Nbecause I was scared to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.29,0:22:24.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a weakling and a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:28.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said I was done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But... they don't want me either!\NNow I have nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I don't wanna die\Nknowing everyone hates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.78,0:22:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to forgive me. Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:23:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will be my first and last act of defiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usohachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.39,0:23:15.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:18.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just one person...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna make amends with just one person...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.31,0:23:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and then I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:26.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:29.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is how I want to be remembered!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:30.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:35.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welp, there goes my energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! She's taking out his soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.67,0:23:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:55.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now eat him, Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's such a klutz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.40,0:24:07.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Out of pity, have some black balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat them and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.82,0:24:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without a soul, even his\Nfavorite snack won't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat them, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.87,0:24:21.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.50,0:24:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat you, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.00,0:24:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.47,0:24:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surging with power!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.64,0:24:45.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She ate him...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.69,0:24:50.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usohachi! Onami! Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.94,0:24:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.95,0:24:55.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.20,0:24:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.33,0:25:06.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama, why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.13,0:25:13.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're leaving me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.72,0:25:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate people who leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.56,0:25:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.56,0:25:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what do we do to people I hate?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill them, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.98,0:25:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:57.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're...!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.68,0:26:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk Gibson!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.54,0:26:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.33,0:26:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.41,0:26:28.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.51,0:26:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.68,0:26:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- Captain Kid!\N- Captain Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.39,0:26:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat it, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.23,0:26:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This old bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.73,0:26:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is my prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.68,0:27:23.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you still trying to defeat me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.80,0:27:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.57,0:27:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? You're getting weaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.51,0:28:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.10,0:28:09.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it already over?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.38,0:28:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.51,0:28:43.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.93,0:28:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this is your limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can still smile?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.34,0:29:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.75,0:29:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.92,0:29:24.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you down again and again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.23,0:30:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.65,0:30:23.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At some point...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.02,0:30:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No... I knew how this\Nwould end from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.41,0:30:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did well infusing yourself\Nwith haki during the battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.62,0:30:39.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But powerful weapons make you cocky, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.09,0:30:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Humans don't give up hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.01,0:30:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, they can't give it up...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.72,0:30:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.77,0:31:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since I was\Nthis fired up. I got careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.44,0:31:07.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should have taken your head\Nas a trophy and declared victory...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.03,0:31:07.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.20,0:31:18.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll all keep believing\Nyou're gonna win, won't they?
